<title>GERMANY: Porsche to issue 200 mln dmk eurobond.</title>
<headline>Porsche to issue 200 mln dmk eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German sports car maker Porsche AG said on Monday it planned to issue a 200 million mark eurobond, lead managed by Deutsche Bank.</p>
<p>The firm also said that it planned to tap capital markets for funds regularly from now on.  </p>
<p>officer, said the eurobond, which has a maturity of five years, would be issued through its Irish financing unit Porsche International Financing Plc in Dublin on Tuesday on Wednesday this week.</p>
<p>He said the coupon had not yet been fixed.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 7565 1246</p>
